<title>HONG KONG: COSCO Pacific to raise HK$1.2 bln for expansion.</title>
<headline>COSCO Pacific to raise HK$1.2 bln for expansion.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>COSCO Pacific Ltd said on Monday it would raise HK$1.2 billion in a share placement at HK$9.95 per share to fund port acquisitions and the expansion of Chinese terminals and container manufacturing plants.  </p>
<p>COSCO Pacific said in a statement it would buy stakes in four Chinese ports from its parent COSCO (Hong Kong) Group Ltd for HK$455 million.</p>
<p>The company said it would also spend HK$250 million on the expansion of the Chinese terminals and container manufacturing plants and HK$494 million for further acquisitions of container terminals in the Asia Pacific region.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
